      "sha": "6840f006da9306345d66736ff21c358a96b7d278",
      "message": "feat(ui): improve merge CLI instructions (#14900)\n\nWith #14831 merged, we can fearlessly copy-paste CLI instructions.\n\nThis change converts CLI instructions to code blocks and adds copy\nbuttons, bringing them up on par with other code blocks.  It builds on\ntop of #14579 and fixes a regression (from that PR) which breaks #14038.\n\nRather than making the template ugly in areas that are sensitive to\nwhitespace, I opted for extending the copy button to trim all empty\nlines and append new lines to the ones with content.  Besides, the\nentirety of merge functionality requires JS, so this way is better.\n\nAdditionally, I also updated the UI and made it more consistent by\nreusing existing markup styles with minimal amount of changes.\n\n| Before                                                      | After                                                       |\n|-------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|\n| ![image](/attachments/5af8fabf-331b-456f-85cf-f8952b9e8500) | ![image](/attachments/55cc15b1-3e6c-4dde-a4ef-74b2324473ac) |\n| ![image](/attachments/f9ed2a7f-486a-4a09-acc9-9ece6270eb73) | ![image](/attachments/f1b02fd3-89af-4508-befc-5bea806ef86b) |\n\nCo-authored-by: 0ko <redacted@example.invalid>\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14900\nReviewed-by: 0ko <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
